      SIMPLE TEST FOR IPL-V             9
      DEFINE REGIONS                    2 A0            6
                                        5       00
      GET SYMB A4 (OPERAND 2)             A0    10A4
      GET SYMB A3 (OPERAND 1)                   10A3
      GET SYMB A3 AGAIN (RESULT NAME)           10A3
      ADD THEM: A3 = A3 + A4                    00J110
      INPUT A3 = RESULT (FRESH)                 10A3
      PRINT RESULT, QUIT.                         J152  0
                                        1
                                        5       01
      CONSTANT 3                          A3    01      3
      CONSTANT 4                          A4    01      4
      START AT A0                       5         A0
